title: Foggy Mountain Breakdown
key: G
type: instrumental
form: AB
feel: 2/4, very fast
rights: copyrighted
notes: Banjo showpiece. Watch the 1 to 6m change.
verified: false
break: The signature move is the 1 → 6m change: hit the b3 → 3 hammer-on over the 1, then outline the 6m.
break.guitar: Crosspick the A part; keep it driving rather than busy.

[A]
| 1 | 1 | 6m | 6m |
| 1 | 1 | 5 | 1 |

[B]
| 1 | 1 | 6m | 6m |
| 1 | 1 | 5 | 1 |
